OL,3,GNEWSAExtremist who attempted to become
OL,4,AIS martyr jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who travelled to Somalia to join
OL,7,Fthe Islamic State (IS) in a failed bid
OL,8,Fto become a "martyr" has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor 12 years.
OL,11,FSomalia-born security guard Mohamed
OL,12,FMohamoud, 22, from Bristol, travelled
OL,13,Fto East Africa in January 2025, but
OL,14,Freturned to England two months later
OL,15,Fafter failing to reach the group
OL,16,Fbecause of UK counter-terrorism
OL,17,Foperations.
OL,19,FFollowing a trial at Winchester Crown
OL,20,FCourt in August, he was found guilty of
OL,21,Fpreparing for acts of terrorism.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
