OL,3,GNEWSAExtremist who attempted to become
OL,4,AIS martyr jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassing his sentence at the Old Bailey
OL,7,Fon Monday, judge Mr Justice Lickley
OL,8,Ftold Mohamoud: "You did everything you
OL,9,Fcould to join IS and were prevented by
OL,10,Ffactors beyond your control."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
